OL,3,GNEWSATape more effective than sandbags
OL,4,Ain flood tests
OL,5,
OL,6,FHomes at risk from flooding could be
OL,7,Fbetter protected in an emergency using
OL,8,Fwidely available gaffer and duct tapes
OL,9,Frather than sandbags, according to
OL,10,Fscientists.
OL,12,FTests using different tapes, sandbags
OL,13,Fand a variety of doors have been
OL,14,Fcarried out at the University of Hull.
OL,16,FThe research found, when compared with
OL,17,Fan unprotected door, flexible synthetic
OL,18,Frubber tape reduced water leakage by
OL,19,F99%, duct tape by 97 to 98% and
OL,20,Fsandbags by 70%.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,384,380,200,160,0,100
