OL,3,GNEWSATape more effective than sandbags
OL,4,Ain flood tests
OL,5,
OL,6,FStuart McLelland, professor of water
OL,7,Fscience, said the research could
OL,8,Fprovide "immediate benefits" by helping
OL,9,Fhouseholds "reduce the amount of
OL,10,Ffloodwater entering their homes".
